WEBVTT

00:17:29.327 --> 00:17:32.342
as Raisuddin tried to do.

00:17:32.342 --> 00:17:34.923
Like him, we can make pilgrimages.

00:17:34.923 --> 00:17:38.446
And there, in Baltimore and Oregon 
and Appalachia,

00:17:38.446 --> 00:17:40.938
find new purpose, as he did.

00:17:40.938 --> 00:17:44.197
We can immerse ourselves 
in that other country,

00:17:44.197 --> 00:17:47.974
bear witness to its hopes and sorrows,

00:17:47.974 --> 00:17:54.829
and, like Raisuddin, ask what we can do.

00:17:54.829 --> 00:17:57.955
What can you do?

00:17:57.955 --> 00:17:59.706
What can you do?

00:17:59.706 --> 00:18:01.679
What can we do?